            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "YouTube TV could lose Disney channels, Getty's new AI partnership",
            "description": "<p>Morning Brief host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Julie Hyman</a> tracks several of the day's top trending stock tickers, including streaming giant Netflix (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NFLX\">NFLX</a>) announcing <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/netflix-announces-10-for-1-stock-split-as-company-aims-to-make-stock-more-accessible-for-employees-204922842.html\">a 10-for-1 stock split</a>, Alphabet's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GOOG\">GOOG</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GOOGL\">GOOGL</a>) YouTube TV to lose Disney-owned (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/DIS\">DIS</a>) channels unless a new distribution agreement is reached, and Getty Images (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GETY\">GETY</a>) striking a new partnership with Perplexity (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PEAI.PVT\">PEAI.PVT</a>).</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/morning-brief/\">Morning Brief</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Morning Brief host Julie Hyman tracks several of the day's top trending stock tickers, including streaming giant Netflix (NFLX) announcing a 10-for-1 stock split, Alphabet's (GOOG, GOOGL) YouTube TV to lose Disney-owned (DIS) channels unless a new distribution agreement is reached, and Getty Images (GETY) striking a new partnership with Perplexity (PEAI.PVT). To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Morning Brief.",
